<title>INDIA: BADMINTON-INDIAN OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-INDIAN OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the Indian Open</p>
<p>Grand Prix series badminton championship on Friday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men singles, quarter-finals</p>
<p>1-Poul Erik Hoyer-Larsen (Denmark) beat Wong Choon Hann</p>
<p>(Malaysia) 15-9 15-13</p>
<p>3-Heryanto Arbi (Indonesia) beat Hashim Roslin (Malaysia) 15-3</p>
<p>15-6</p>
<p>P.Gopichand (India) beat Jang Chon-wong (South Korea)</p>
<p>8-15 15-3 15-4</p>
<p>Kim Hyung-joon (South Korea) beat Jason Wong (Malaysia) 18-17</p>
<p>15-10</p>
<p>Women singles, quarter finals</p>
<p>2-Joanne Muggeridge (England) beat Nilima Chaudhury (India)</p>
<p>11-7 11-4</p>
<p>Lee Soon-deuk (South Korea) beat Olivia Herdtiono (Indonesia)</p>
<p>11-12 11-6 11-6</p>
</text>
